<!doctype lake><title>Policy Optimization V</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="emcjO" id="emcjO"><span data-lake-id="u40d38709" id="u40d38709">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="u57e3ad04" id="u57e3ad04"> 𝐒𝐜𝐨𝐫𝐞 𝐂𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐒𝐭𝐚𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐳𝐞𝐬 𝐎𝐟𝐟-𝐏𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 𝐑𝐞𝐢𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐜𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐋𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u352b7c48" id="u352b7c48"><strong><span data-lake-id="u09b01158" id="u09b01158">强化学习已成为当前大语言模型训练的关键环节，分配给这一阶段的训练计算资源占比正不断提高。这一过程通常采用 PPO、GRPO、DAPO 和 IcePop 等算法，这些算法均以策略梯度方法为基础</span></strong></p><ul list="u05c39629"><li fid="u688964fc" data-lake-id="uaaf2d22d" id="uaaf2d22d"><span data-lake-id="uf8a807a2" id="uf8a807a2">基于策略梯度的大语言模型强化学习训练包括</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uabc9b370" id="uabc9b370" style="color: #DF2A3F">采样生成序列（rollout）、为每条序列赋予奖励，以及根据奖励对生成序列加权以计算梯度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubc7bb8cc" id="ubc7bb8cc">。形式化地，对于从策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lOKZF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue727b231" id="ue727b231">采样的生成序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HMkFo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1343acc8" id="u1343acc8">，期望奖励的梯度等于由奖励</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22U2ES6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22R%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubed48bd9" id="ubed48bd9">加权的得分（score）的期望</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1d2d67ac" id="u1d2d67ac" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22a8Z0P%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5BR%5D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5CnR%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(y)%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bscore%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua1e8910b"><li fid="u6170bc8b" data-lake-id="u822c0479" id="u822c0479"><span data-lake-id="u6509b0ed" id="u6509b0ed">在实际实现中，计算式（1）的右端需要分别通过模型执行两次前向传播：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7328cd75" id="u7328cd75" style="color: #5C0036">第一次由采样器（即推理引擎）执行，用于生成序列；第二次由训练器执行，用于在已生成的序列上计算梯度</span></strong></li><li fid="u6170bc8b" data-lake-id="u5cf58528" id="u5cf58528"><span data-lake-id="u7c484ca6" id="u7c484ca6">理论上，训练器与采样器表示同一个模型，输出应当一致，但实际并非如此。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf30e9565" id="uf30e9565" style="color: #270070">大多数强化学习代码库允许训练引擎与推理引擎之间存在微小的数值差异，由此产生训练—推理不匹配（training-inference mismatch，TIM）。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u082b7725" id="u082b7725">大语言模型的强化学习对这些微小差异高度敏感。TIM 可能降低训练性能，甚至导致奖励完全崩溃。相比之下，监督微调即使使用来自另一模型或人工标注者的样本，通常也能保持稳定的训练动态，而无须进行额外调整。然而，彻底消除 TIM 并不现实，因为这会显著降低序列采样效率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0a57a531" id="u0a57a531"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4a78bc54" id="u4a78bc54" style="color: #AD1A2B">本文研究强化学习对训练—推理不匹配高度敏感的原因。通过分析策略梯度更新，表明其中包含一个漂移（drift）项，该项当且仅当训练策略与采样策略相匹配时为零。TIM 下的强化学习不稳定性主要源于这种漂移，即训练引擎与推理引擎之间持续存在、并随每个训练步骤不断累积的偏差。基于这一发现，提出 score centering 方法，通过引入加性校正项抵消漂移，从而稳定存在 TIM 的强化学习训练</span></strong></p><ul list="ud8f56bab"><li fid="u9db4f47c" data-lake-id="u75074b71" id="u75074b71"><span data-lake-id="ude6ac4c2" id="ude6ac4c2">score centering 采用加性校正形式，并与重要性采样具有正交性，因此二者可以组合使用，以获得进一步的性能提升。在策略陈旧性实验中，二者的组合优于仅使用重要性采样的基线方法</span></li></ul><figure data-lake-id="ubb670289" id="ubb670289" class="lake-figure" style="width:660.8px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A660.8%2C%22height%22%3A242.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A826%2C%22originHeight%22%3A303%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22ud323f65b%22%7D" data-asset="assets/e36d665568f12de73a8a49e3a060e3c5.png"></card></figure><h2 data-lake-id="sQ7wf" id="sQ7wf"><span data-lake-id="u33ed4daf" id="u33ed4daf">🌟</span><span data-lake-id="u649d6480" id="u649d6480"> 𝐁𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐑𝐞𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u930d4ffc" id="u930d4ffc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a0e0456" id="u6a0e0456">朴素策略梯度恒等式仅在计算梯度的策略与生成采样序列的策略相同时成立。然而，在实际应用中，生成序列由采样器</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Sjsxd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u18dfe683" id="u18dfe683">产生，梯度则通过训练器</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LCQLi%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubfc7d573" id="ubfc7d573">计算。因此，当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Z3miM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cneq%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u16573bc1" id="u16573bc1">时，便会出现训练—推理不匹配</span></strong></p><ul list="u32e71d08"><li fid="u7755c18a" data-lake-id="u4dc37559" id="u4dc37559"><span data-lake-id="u5e175cd2" id="u5e175cd2">TIM 的来源多种多样，其严重程度也各不相同。在最严重的情况下，训练引擎与推理引擎采用不同的数值精度，或分别基于两个独立的代码库；各代码库可能包含不同且难以检测的缺陷，从而导致输出出现细微差异。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uda32189d" id="uda32189d" style="color: #00346B">在程度较轻的情况下，即使两个引擎的实现均正确且使用相同的 GPU 内核，也仍可能因浮点运算不满足结合律而产生不同的输出</span></strong></li><li fid="u7755c18a" data-lake-id="u758a98db" id="u758a98db"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2337cf50" id="u2337cf50" style="color: #00346B">由于采样以自回归方式进行，而训练通常沿序列维度并行执行，训练引擎与推理引擎可能以不同的输入形状调用同一内核，从而改变归约运算的顺序，产生微小的浮点数值差异</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubfdf64b2" id="ubfdf64b2">。批次不变内核能够消除对输入形状的依赖，但需要大量工程投入，并会降低 GPU 利用率。将两个引擎的数值精度均由 bf16 切换为 fp16，也能显著减轻不匹配，但无法将其完全消除</span></li><li fid="u7755c18a" data-lake-id="ua3e41ffd" id="ua3e41ffd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u983e96be" id="u983e96be" style="color: #00346B">最后，即使训练器与生成器采用完全相同的批次不变内核，更新滞后仍可能导致 TIM。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udab057e9" id="udab057e9">为提高强化学习的 GPU 利用率，训练与推理引擎解耦并异步运行，生成服务采用连续批处理。同一训练批次中的生成序列，甚至单条生成序列的不同子序列，都可能来自不同的模型检查点。在智能体编程等长上下文环境中，策略陈旧性尤为严重：某些回合可能在数分钟内结束，而另一些则可能持续数小时甚至数天。从硬件利用率看，更理想的做法是通过算法稳定基于陈旧序列的训练，而非彻底消除策略陈旧性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u35f04efc" id="u35f04efc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ac8ec62" id="u9ac8ec62">重要性采样校正：假设式（1）中的生成序列来自采样器</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22paXs7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u08a84f89" id="u08a84f89">，而非训练器</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UvAV8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u66afeff3" id="u66afeff3">，且</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22x15c4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cneq%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0375eb7e" id="u0375eb7e">。此时可通过重要性采样精确校正 TIM</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u02790780" id="u02790780" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Al8TF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5BR%5D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5CnR%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(y)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(y)%7D%7Bq_%5C%5Ctheta(y)%7D%5CnR%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(y)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4773cbe8"><li fid="u8978643f" data-lake-id="ua5133655" id="ua5133655"><span data-lake-id="u362c08ea" id="u362c08ea">通常逐 token 应用重要性比率。无论采用哪种方式，重要性采样均以增加方差为代价校正 TIM。经奖励加权的得分还需乘以重要性比率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ksQWl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(y)%7D%7Bq_%5C%5Ctheta(y)%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa3cb6c2" id="ufa3cb6c2">；该比率在罕见 token 上可能取任意大的值，从而增大梯度估计的方差。由于直接使用原始重要性比率进行训练并不稳定，实际采用的方法会对重要性比率施加界限，而这不可避免地会引入偏差</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="JMMym" id="JMMym"><span data-lake-id="u87f32b65" id="u87f32b65">📡</span><span data-lake-id="u3f7ef80b" id="u3f7ef80b"> 𝐖𝐡𝐲 𝐑𝐋 𝐈𝐬 𝐒𝐞𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐭𝐨 𝐌𝐢𝐬𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐜𝐡</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ua6cda5e6" id="ua6cda5e6"><span data-lake-id="u4c560913" id="u4c560913">为理解强化学习对训练—推理不匹配的敏感性，先考察其与监督微调的区别。即使存在严重得多的不匹配，SFT 仍能保持稳定，训练可以离线使用另一模型的数据，无须重要性采样校正，SFT 对策略陈旧性或内核选择并不敏感。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u13b2ac88" id="u13b2ac88" style="color: #DF2A3F">关键在于，对于具有二元奖励的任务，当优势取值为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nECDq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2B1%2F0%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b0d1630" id="u1b0d1630" style="color: #DF2A3F">（即奖励未经中心化或归一化），且训练完全离线进行（即采样器从不更新）时，策略梯度便退化为 SFT：成功样本提供对数似然梯度，失败样本的梯度为零，训练目标因此等同于对固定成功样本进行最大似然拟合。希望确定，究竟是哪一种机制导致对 TIM 的敏感性增强</span></strong></p><figure data-lake-id="u3f8b4b27" id="u3f8b4b27" class="lake-figure" style="width:701.6000366210938px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A701.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A312.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1342%2C%22originHeight%22%3A596%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufb5952e3%22%7D" data-asset="assets/328605a0d6e02f3b768957e9b9270d78.png"></card></figure><ul list="ueda6a65e"><li fid="u491b33cc" data-lake-id="u5054eaab" id="u5054eaab"><span data-lake-id="ua115b1c5" id="ua115b1c5">离线训练仅在采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ADXAH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2B1%2F0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39bad73c" id="u39bad73c">（非负）奖励时保持稳定，而在线训练的情况恰好相反：组内中心化奖励在同一组内同时包含正值和负值，其训练最为稳定；相反，在离线训练中最稳定的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22njdIV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2B1%2F0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufe66ebae" id="ufe66ebae">奖励，在在线训练中却最不稳定</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaf6090bf" id="uaf6090bf"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8091c609" id="u8091c609">推测存在两种不同的作用机制：一种使采用负奖励的离线训练不稳定，另一种使采用正奖励的在线训练不稳定</span></strong></p><ul list="ub291fe0b"><li fid="u7c3e67b3" data-lake-id="u731eae2d" id="u731eae2d"><span data-lake-id="u1aaf25b7" id="u1aaf25b7">Ren 与 Sutherland（2025）认为，这种不稳定性的主要机制在于负奖励的无界性与分布尖锐化的共同作用。对数概率没有下界，因此，在采用负奖励的离线训练中，对数概率可能趋于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22s2L3k%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cinfty%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2b712ba3" id="u2b712ba3">。在线训练不存在这一效应，因为其中只会采样到高概率 token</span></li><li fid="u7c3e67b3" data-lake-id="u5c3a832e" id="u5c3a832e"><span data-lake-id="u5455eea8" id="u5455eea8">不对称性已有充分记载：仅使用正样本进行训练，即蒸馏或拒绝采样微调，即使在离线条件下也完全稳定；而负梯度可能降低正确回答的概率，尽管在同策略条件下，负梯度能够提供有用的学习信号</span></li><li fid="u7c3e67b3" data-lake-id="u2ce6981c" id="u2ce6981c"><span data-lake-id="u0a4aff94" id="u0a4aff94">在线训练呈现出与离线训练相反的行为：仅使用正奖励是最不稳定的设置。这种不稳定性可能源于训练的在线性质。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ed2c9cf" id="u5ed2c9cf" style="color: #00346B">需要注意的是，在存在 TIM 的情况下，采用</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FFSUV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2B1%2F0%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8b6d32f" id="ud8b6d32f" style="color: #00346B">奖励进行在线训练，本身也是一种蒸馏：训练器拟合采样器生成的成功序列，而采样器是训练器自身的有偏副本，其权重在每个训练步骤后由训练器刷新</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6acb2c2e" id="u6acb2c2e">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u347d916d" id="u347d916d" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)">与离线蒸馏的区别在于教师随学生变化，这可能导致不稳定</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="poCrr" id="poCrr"><span data-lake-id="u3f4df3c3" id="u3f4df3c3">🌊 𝐒𝐜𝐨𝐫𝐞 𝐂𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u98a053c7" id="u98a053c7"><span data-lake-id="u30e6be79" id="u30e6be79">考察在给定前缀</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Zioso%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22y_%7B%3Ct%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9eabce91" id="u9eabce91">的条件下，单个 token</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PGp6E%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22y_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u23f49607" id="u23f49607">对更新的期望贡献。采样器</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22txmst%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u38f8acf4" id="u38f8acf4">生成 token</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NzLsC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22y_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5aeeba19" id="u5aeeba19">；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bJd1N%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uda1dcc26" id="uda1dcc26">为词表中的 token 索引。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xKDRl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufb41657f" id="ufb41657f">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mbIkc%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucfd7e13e" id="ucfd7e13e">分别表示训练器</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NfP38%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc37ed340" id="uc37ed340">与采样器</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mueah%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u294c9837" id="u294c9837">赋予next token 为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CwGFN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e3ea98f" id="u6e3ea98f">的概率，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rTDYR%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_v%20%3D%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20p_v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89a1c5c7" id="u89a1c5c7">为其得分，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OqeKF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7Bs%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_v%20q_v%20s_v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u813a435b" id="u813a435b">为采样器分布下的期望得分</span></p><ul list="u6d441db3"><li fid="u2bf17e8d" data-lake-id="uc0810fd9" id="uc0810fd9"><span data-lake-id="u7e85e087" id="u7e85e087">考虑在奖励恒为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lRG0u%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2B1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud52a43b5" id="ud52a43b5">的环境中，使用朴素策略梯度进行强化学习训练。理论上，此时不应发生学习：奖励为常数，环境没有提供任何信号。事实上，在同策略条件下，每个前缀处的期望梯度确实为零</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf4b79efe" id="uf4b79efe" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uTFXG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_p%5BR%20s_%7By_t%7D%5D%5Cn%3D%5CnR%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_p%5Bs_%7By_t%7D%5D%5Cn%3D%5CnR%5C%5Ccdot%200.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua8232216" id="ua8232216" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vDDDC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_p%5Bs_%7By_t%7D%5D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_v%20p_v%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20p_v%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Csum_v%20p_v%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%201%5Cn%3D%5Cn0.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uab4273e6"><li fid="ub94ae488" data-lake-id="u9aaefac3" id="u9aaefac3"><span data-lake-id="ue615eb56" id="ue615eb56">在存在训练—推理不匹配（TIM）时，期望梯度通常不为零：token 由采样器</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UMsRS%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u05233878" id="u05233878">生成，而得分通过训练器</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Iejh0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u786b052f" id="u786b052f">计算，因此一般有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DtYEo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7Bs%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5Bs_%7By_t%7D%5D%20%5C%5Cneq%200%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0de4b068" id="u0de4b068">。利用协方差恒等式，可以将给定前缀处的期望策略梯度更新分解为漂移项和信号项</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6d95d617" id="u6d95d617" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WTQD0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7B%23273348%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5BR%20s_%7By_t%7D%5D%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bpolicy%20gradient%20update%7D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7B%23c65d4a%7D%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5BR%5D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cbar%7Bs%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7B%E2%80%9Cdrift%E2%80%9D%7D%7D%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7B%23077f78%7D%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCov%7D_q(R%2Cs_%7By_t%7D)%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7B%E2%80%9Csignal%E2%80%9D%7D%7D%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u90befb06" id="u90befb06"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf457f1b2" id="uf457f1b2">漂移由 TIM 引起，其作用相当于向采样器进行蒸馏</span></strong></p><ul list="u215c7e50"><li fid="u97a9f784" data-lake-id="uf7235e7e" id="uf7235e7e"><span data-lake-id="u48f0f26c" id="u48f0f26c">漂移项不包含有关哪些生成序列取得成功的信息：它对奖励的依赖仅体现为奖励均值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fwIHV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5BR%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u310611c8" id="u310611c8">。只有协方差项能够反映哪个 token 导致何种奖励。漂移项的作用则由其方向</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OtzIz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7Bs%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77f9aab7" id="u77f9aab7">决定：期望得分等于以采样器为教师的交叉熵损失的负梯度，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uab8f89fb" id="uab8f89fb" style="color: #DF2A3F">因此，朴素策略梯度会在每个前缀处将训练器向采样器蒸馏，并以该前缀处的期望奖励作为缩放系数</span></strong></li><li fid="u97a9f784" data-lake-id="ud78fa18c" id="ud78fa18c"><span data-lake-id="ub3b15847" id="ub3b15847">这一效应完全由 TIM 引起：在同策略条件下，训练器已经与采样器匹配，因此</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ch2a3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7Bs%7D%20%3D%200%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9d4cb04" id="ue9d4cb04">，漂移项随之消失。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u521dec58" id="u521dec58" style="color: #DF2A3F">向固定教师进行蒸馏并无不良影响，因为该过程会收敛至对教师的最大似然拟合。然而，采样器并非固定不变，而是训练器的有偏副本，例如经过量化或权重滞后的副本</span></strong></li><li fid="u97a9f784" data-lake-id="u068bb10a" id="u068bb10a"><span data-lake-id="u99f669cc" id="u99f669cc">每次更新推动训练器趋近采样器，权重同步回采样器后，误差在反馈中累积而非收敛。这解释全部采用正奖励的在线训练为何最不稳定。Dong et al.（2026）同样将系统性偏差视为 TIM 下训练不稳定的根源，并表明偏差会通过正反馈不断累积</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue26b9981" id="ue26b9981"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a1ed2b7" id="u9a1ed2b7">组内中心化不能消除漂移</span></strong></p><ul list="u14a2438b"><li fid="u61044ff0" data-lake-id="uc1d32466" id="uc1d32466"><span data-lake-id="uaf35c366" id="uaf35c366">组内中心化使同一提示词对应的各条生成序列的优势之和为零，但漂移发生在各个具体前缀处，而给定前缀处的期望优势并不为零，更可能导向正确答案的前缀具有正的期望优势，已经包含错误的前缀则具有负的期望优势。因此，恰恰是在承载学习信号的前缀处，漂移不为零</span></li><li fid="u61044ff0" data-lake-id="u4db4aed5" id="u4db4aed5"><span data-lake-id="uade422f3" id="uade422f3">在期望优势为正的前缀之后，训练器会被拉向采样器；在期望优势为负的前缀之后，训练器则会被推离采样器，而不论相关 token 是否影响奖励。与采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jAiiS%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2B1%2F0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u62779de6" id="u62779de6">奖励相比，组内中心化确实能够减小漂移，但它并不能消除漂移</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3fb49269" id="u3fb49269"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf9c49f16" id="uf9c49f16" style="color: #5C0036">score centering 能够消除漂移：上述观察直接引出提出的 score centering 方法，即使存在 TIM，仍希望每个前缀处的期望得分均为零，如同同策略条件下那样。为此，只需从每个得分中减去采样器分布下的期望得分，将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TLTMJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%7By_t%7D%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud12b7182" id="ud12b7182" style="color: #5C0036">替换为中心化得分</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UYYRO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bs%7D_%7By_t%7D%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua6f128d4" id="ua6f128d4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kN3x5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bs%7D_%7By_t%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cns_%7By_t%7D-%5C%5Cbar%7Bs%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5161764d"><li fid="u64fcb003" data-lake-id="u0486590a" id="u0486590a"><span data-lake-id="u89d44bf6" id="u89d44bf6">采用 score centering 后，期望策略梯度更新变为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub50be909" id="ub50be909" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hx2xm%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5BR%5C%5Ctilde%7Bs%7D_%7By_t%7D%5D%5Cn%26%3D%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7B%237030ae%7D%5C%5Coverset%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5B%5C%5Ctilde%7Bs%7D_%7By_t%7D%5D%3D%5C%5Cbar%7Bs%7D-%5C%5Cbar%7Bs%7D%3D0%7D%7B%5C%5Ccancel%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5BR%5D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5B%5C%5Ctilde%7Bs%7D_%7By_t%7D%5D%7D%7D%7D%5Cn%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCov%7D_q(R%2C%5C%5Ctilde%7Bs%7D_%7By_t%7D)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCov%7D_q(R%2C%5C%5Ctilde%7Bs%7D_%7By_t%7D)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCov%7D_q(R%2Cs_%7By_t%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Clongleftarrow%5C%5Cquad%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bgathered%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bonly%20difference%20to%20on-policy%20update%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bis%20the%20covariance%20sampling%20distribution%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bgathered%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u55d2b02a"><li fid="u79881dfb" data-lake-id="u249791ce" id="u249791ce"><strong><span data-lake-id="u54623552" id="u54623552" style="color: #DF2A3F">定义的中心化得分在采样器分布下具有零均值，因为两个期望在同一分布下计算。即使在离策略条件下，每个前缀的漂移也会被精确抵消</span></strong></li><li fid="u79881dfb" data-lake-id="u8edda6c5" id="u8edda6c5"><strong style="color: #1f6f43"><span data-lake-id="uab2ba866" id="uab2ba866">采用 score centering 后的期望更新与同策略期望更新之间，唯一的差异在于计算协方差时所采用的分布：在同策略条件下，以及存在 TIM 但使用重要性采样时，协方差均在训练分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22S3snj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7B%231f6f43%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud56acf7b" id="ud56acf7b">下计算；而 score centering 在采样分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22k74vK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7B%231f6f43%7Dq_%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u44210c4c" id="u44210c4c">下计算协方差。当不存在 TIM，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MfqHX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7B%231f6f43%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta%20%3D%20q_%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0fa1ab63" id="u0fa1ab63">时，校正项恰好为零，因此 score centering 不改变原有更新</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u784fdd32" id="u784fdd32"><strong><span data-lake-id="u69d29f3e" id="u69d29f3e">score centering 与重要性采样：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u60a640b1" id="u60a640b1">与 score centering 一样，重要性采样也能够精确抵消漂移</span></p><ul list="uc0cd2a41"><li fid="ua3324161" data-lake-id="u6a68c84f" id="u6a68c84f"><span data-lake-id="ub0dc7224" id="ub0dc7224">重要性采样使用随机的乘性校正项，其取值依赖于采样到的 token，并会增加梯度方差。对于罕见 token，重要性比率可能非常大，因此，几乎所有实际实现都会以某种方式对较大的重要性比率进行裁剪或掩蔽，从而重新引入漂移</span></li><li fid="ua3324161" data-lake-id="u297987c0" id="u297987c0"><span data-lake-id="u647c6955" id="u647c6955">相比之下，score centering 采用加性校正项，该项在给定前缀后是确定的：它不依赖于采样到的 token，并且可以精确计算。由于 score centering 与重要性采样以彼此独立的方式校正 TIM，因此两种方法可以组合使用</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8479c823" id="u8479c823"><strong><span data-lake-id="u54984af4" id="u54984af4">与经典基线方法的关系：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uab592d22" id="uab592d22">从策略梯度中减去零均值项，是一种经典的方差缩减思路：奖励基线与得分函数控制变量均依赖于恒等式</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HKgQ0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_p%5Bs_%7By_t%7D%5D%20%3D%200%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud2c355e9"><li fid="u5e50b85c" data-lake-id="u27b6ebec" id="u27b6ebec"><span data-lake-id="u353fb21a" id="u353fb21a">score centering 则是一种偏差校正方法，而非方差缩减方法：所减去的向量在给定前缀后是确定的，其选择旨在改变更新的均值；相比之下，在同策略条件下，奖励基线改变的是方差，而非均值</span></li><li fid="u5e50b85c" data-lake-id="u1397baac" id="u1397baac"><span data-lake-id="ue75d853e" id="ue75d853e">在离策略条件下，如果奖励基线等于给定前缀处的期望奖励，即采用精确价值函数，也能够在期望意义下抵消漂移；score centering 则无须使用评论家模型，即可获得相同的期望更新</span></li><li fid="u5e50b85c" data-lake-id="ubc831b81" id="ubc831b81"><span data-lake-id="u5acfe44d" id="u5acfe44d">在同策略条件下，该期望为零；而在传统离策略强化学习中，计算它涉及难以求解的动作空间期望，因此离策略方法转而依赖重要性采样。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub78b29d4" id="ub78b29d4" style="color: #70000D">存在 TIM 的大语言模型强化学习训练具有特殊性：期望得分既不为零，又能够通过对next token 的对数概率求和进行精确计算</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ude06a9aa" id="ude06a9aa"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4f7bbd90" id="u4f7bbd90">存储采样器完整的next token 概率分布，成本高得难以承受。因此，仅记录其 top-k </span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="uce358b4f" id="uce358b4f">对数概率，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YI47D%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22k%20%3D%20128%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9d367b12" id="u9d367b12">，并使用训练器的分布对尾部建模，再进行缩放，使其尾部概率质量与采样器一致。将 score centering 实现为以下标量损失</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ueab088d2" id="ueab088d2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jdTvP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%5Cn%3D%5Cn-R%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Clog%20p_%7By_t%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bv%5C%5Cin%20H%7D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5Bq_v-%5C%5Crho%20p_v%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_v%5Cn%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud0820f94"><li fid="u10bcd9de" data-lake-id="u59c9be5a" id="u59c9be5a"><span data-lake-id="u600be9a2" id="u600be9a2">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZzDfA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Crho%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf092bc1b" id="uf092bc1b">为采样器与训练器的尾部概率质量之比，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Aw9ZL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u23d8a3fe" id="u23d8a3fe">表示停止梯度</span></li></ul><card type="block" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20jax.numpy%20as%20jnp%5Cnfrom%20jax.lax%20import%20stop_gradient%5Cn%5Cndef%20score_centering_loss(train_logp%2C%20samp_logp%2C%20topk_ids%2C%20sampled_token%2C%20advantage)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_head_logp%20%3D%20train_logp%5Btopk_ids%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20tail_mass_ratio%20%3D%20(1%20-%20jnp.exp(samp_logp).sum())%20%2F%20(1%20-%20jnp.exp(train_head_logp).sum())%5Cn%20%20%20%20head_prob_residual%20%3D%20jnp.exp(samp_logp)%20-%20tail_mass_ratio%20*%20jnp.exp(train_head_logp)%5Cn%20%20%20%20logp_correction%20%3D%20(stop_gradient(head_prob_residual)%20*%20train_head_logp).sum()%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20-advantage%20*%20(train_logp%5Bsampled_token%5D%20-%20logp_correction)%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22Score%20Centering%20%C2%B7%20%E5%8D%95%20token%20%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%22%7D"></card><h2 id="appendix">🧮 Appendix</h2><!-- Appendix A.1–A.3, 2609.20807v1.pdf. Original equations (7)–(12) map to (A.1)–(A.6). --><h3 id="a1-topk-approximation">A.1 Top-k Approximation</h3><p><strong>完整 score centering 在多数实际应用中的成本过高。计算正文中的 score centering 校正项，即对采样器逐 token 分布下的得分求期望，需要为每个采样位置保存完整的输出对数概率。例如，Qwen3 的词表大小约为 152K，以 FP32 保存单个位置的完整对数概率就需要约 608 KB。若一个批次包含 1024 条 rollout，每条序列长 32K，所需存储约为 20 TB</strong></p><ul><li>因此，只保存采样器分布的 top-k 近似，默认取 128，并使用训练器的对数概率补齐尾部，以近似采样器的完整分布。令<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%20q%22%7D"></card>表示近似采样分布，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22H%22%7D"></card>表示 top-k token 构成的头部集合，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card>表示其余 token 构成的尾部集合。头部直接使用采样器的概率，尾部使用训练器的概率，并进行缩放，使整个分布的概率之和为 1</li></ul><p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-24%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%20q_v%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cnq_v%2C%26v%5C%5Cin%20H%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Crho%20p_v%2C%26v%5C%5Cin%20T%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Crho%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Csum_%7Bv%5C%5Cin%20H%7Dq_v%7D%7B1-%5C%5Csum_%7Bv%5C%5Cin%20H%7Dp_v%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7BA.1%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li>标量<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Crho%22%7D"></card>是采样器与训练器的尾部概率质量之比，用它缩放训练器的尾部，就能使<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%20q%22%7D"></card>归一化。计算重建分布下的期望得分无需遍历词表：头部用采样器概率精确计算；尾部来自训练器，利用训练器在完整词表上的期望得分为零，可将尾部之和改写为头部之和的相反数</li></ul><p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-25%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Chat%20q%7D%5Bs_%7By_t%7D%5D%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bv%5C%5Cin%20H%7Dq_v%20s_v%2B%5C%5Crho%5C%5Csum_%7Bv%5C%5Cin%20T%7Dp_v%20s_v%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bv%5C%5Cin%20H%7Dq_v%20s_v%2B%5C%5Crho%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_p%5Bs_%7By_t%7D%5D%7D_%7B%3D0%7D-%5C%5Csum_%7Bv%5C%5Cin%20H%7Dp_v%20s_v%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bv%5C%5Cin%20H%7D(q_v-%5C%5Crho%20p_v)s_v.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7BA.2%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li>虽然尾部模型覆盖整个词表，中心化项实际上只需要计算头部的 k 个 token，因此额外开销很小。在相同硬件条件下，论文中 0.6B 和 30B 模型采用 128 个头部 token 的训练耗时，与基线方法的差异都在 1% 以内。作者的自定义 JAX 采样器在解码过程中计算 top-k 对数概率；vLLM 和 SGLang 原生提供 top-k 对数概率接口，但论文没有测量这两个引擎的额外开销</li></ul><h3 id="a2-composing-score-centering-with-importance-sampling">A.2 Composing Score Centering with Importance Sampling</h3><p><strong>score centering 减去的校正项是期望得分。TIS、MIS 等重要性采样方法则使用经过裁剪或掩蔽的重要性比率，对得分重新加权。因此，与重要性采样组合时，需要计算加权得分的期望。可以将这一过程理解为先通过重要性采样对得分加权，再对加权后的得分进行中心化</strong></p><ul><li>令<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r_v%3Dp_v%2Fq_v%22%7D"></card>为重要性比率，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22w_v%3Df(r_v)%22%7D"></card>为重要性采样方法赋予的权重。例如，TIS 使用<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(r)%3D%5C%5Cmin(r%2C2)%22%7D"></card>。中心化更新及其校正项为</li></ul><p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-26%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22R%5C%5Cleft(w_%7By_t%7Ds_%7By_t%7D-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5Bw_%7By_t%7Ds_%7By_t%7D%5D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5Bw_%7By_t%7Ds_%7By_t%7D%5D%3D%5C%5Csum_v%20q_v%20w_v%20s_v.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7BA.3%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li><p>与普通 score centering 一样，奖励为常数时，期望更新恰好为零。无论采用哪一种加权函数，减去期望加权得分都能从构造上抵消漂移</p></li><li><p>式（A.2）的 top-k 化简同样适用。尾部的采样器概率只能由<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-10%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%20q%22%7D"></card>近似，因此尾部权重也在该分布下计算：<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-11%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%20w_v%3Df(p_v%2F%5C%5Chat%20q_v)%22%7D"></card>；在头部，它与<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-12%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22w_v%22%7D"></card>相同。在尾部，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-13%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_v%2F%5C%5Chat%20q_v%3Dp_v%2F(%5C%5Crho%20p_v)%3D1%2F%5C%5Crho%22%7D"></card>是常数，因此中心化项仍只涉及头部，只需将标量<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-14%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Crho%22%7D"></card>替换为<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-15%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%22%7D"></card></p></li></ul><p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-27%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Chat%20q%7D%5B%5C%5Chat%20w_%7By_t%7Ds_%7By_t%7D%5D%5Cn%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bv%5C%5Cin%20H%7D(q_v%20w_v-%5C%5Calpha%20p_v)s_v%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Calpha%3D%5C%5Crho%20f(1%2F%5C%5Crho).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7BA.4%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li>普通 score centering 是<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-16%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f%5C%5Cequiv1%22%7D"></card>的特例，此时<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-17%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%3D%5C%5Crho%22%7D"></card>。作为一致性检查，若采用未经裁剪的重要性采样<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-18%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(r)%3Dr%22%7D"></card>，则<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-19%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%3D1%22%7D"></card>且<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-20%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_vw_v%3Dp_v%22%7D"></card>，中心化项随之消失：精确重要性采样的期望加权得分本来就为零，无须再次中心化</li></ul><h3 id="a3-loss-formulation">A.3 Loss Formulation</h3><p><strong>将 score centering 写成标量损失，就能在自动微分框架中高效实现。由于期望得分是逐 token 得分的加权和，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-21%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%20s%3D%5C%5Csum_v%20q_v%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Clog%20p_v%22%7D"></card>，可以用停止梯度的采样器概率对训练器的对数概率加权。对于策略梯度，损失为</strong></p><p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-28%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%3D-R%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Clog%20p_%7By_t%7D-%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Csum_v%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5Bq_v%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_v%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bcentering%20term%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7BA.5%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li>其中<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-22%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%7D"></card>表示停止梯度，即不对采样概率求导。求导即可恢复中心化更新：<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-23%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20L%3DR(s_%7By_t%7D-%5C%5Cbar%20s)%3DR%5C%5Ctilde%20s_%7By_t%7D%22%7D"></card>。结合任意重要性权重的通用 top-k 版本采用相同方式，并且只需要计算头部 token</li></ul><p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-29%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%3D-R%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5Bw_%7By_t%7D%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7By_t%7D%5Cn-%5C%5Csum_%7Bv%5C%5Cin%20H%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5Bq_vw_v-%5C%5Calpha%20p_v%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_v%5Cn%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7BA.6%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li><code>weight_fn</code> 指定加权函数，默认对应普通 score centering，传入 <code>weight_fn=tis_weight</code> 或 <code>weight_fn=mis_weight</code> 即可分别与 TIS 或 MIS 组合。<code>train_logp</code> 覆盖整个词表，<code>samp_logp</code> 保存采样器的 top-k 对数概率；<code>samp_token_logp</code> 保存实际采样 token 的采样器对数概率，即使该 token 不在头部也必须提供。为数值稳定，尾部概率质量以 <code>eps</code> 为下界。与式（A.6）一致，采样 token 的重要性权重和中心化系数都停止梯度</li></ul><card type="block" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22score-centering-30%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20jax.numpy%20as%20jnp%5Cnfrom%20jax.lax%20import%20stop_gradient%5Cn%5Cndef%20score_centering_loss(train_logp%2C%20samp_logp%2C%20topk_ids%2C%20sampled_token%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20samp_token_logp%2C%20advantage%2C%20weight_fn%3Dlambda%20r%3A%201.0%2C%20eps%3D1e-6)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_head_logp%20%3D%20train_logp%5Btopk_ids%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20head_weights%20%3D%20weight_fn(jnp.exp(train_head_logp%20-%20samp_logp))%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_tail_mass%20%3D%20jnp.maximum(1%20-%20jnp.exp(train_head_logp).sum()%2C%20eps)%5Cn%20%20%20%20samp_tail_mass%20%3D%20jnp.maximum(1%20-%20jnp.exp(samp_logp).sum()%2C%20eps)%5Cn%20%20%20%20tail_mass_ratio%20%3D%20samp_tail_mass%20%2F%20train_tail_mass%5Cn%20%20%20%20tail_scale%20%3D%20tail_mass_ratio%20*%20weight_fn(1%20%2F%20tail_mass_ratio)%5Cn%20%20%20%20head_prob_residual%20%3D%20jnp.exp(samp_logp)%20*%20head_weights%5Cn%20%20%20%20head_prob_residual%20-%3D%20tail_scale%20*%20jnp.exp(train_head_logp)%5Cn%20%20%20%20logp_correction%20%3D%20(stop_gradient(head_prob_residual)%20*%20train_head_logp).sum()%5Cn%20%20%20%20sampled_ratio%20%3D%20jnp.exp(train_logp%5Bsampled_token%5D%20-%20samp_token_logp)%5Cn%20%20%20%20weighted_logp%20%3D%20stop_gradient(weight_fn(sampled_ratio))%20*%20train_logp%5Bsampled_token%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20-advantage%20*%20(weighted_logp%20-%20logp_correction)%5Cn%5Cntis_weight%20%3D%20lambda%20r%3A%20jnp.minimum(r%2C%202.0)%5Cnmis_weight%20%3D%20lambda%20r%3A%20jnp.where((r%20%3E%3D%200.5)%20%26%20(r%20%3C%3D%205.0)%2C%20r%2C%200.0)%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22Score%20Centering%20%C2%B7%20%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%20TIS%20%2F%20MIS%20%E7%9A%84%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%22%7D"></card>